8,Gha-Mu language — Grokipedia,https://grokipedia.com/page/gha_mu_language,"[2] Classified within the Hmong-Mien language family under the Hmongic branch—specifically the Western Hmongic subgroup and Farwestern Hmong dialect cluster—Gha-Mu is mutually unintelligible with other Miao (Hmong) varieties in China, such as Big Flowery Miao (A-Hmao).","Miao, Small Flowery",Hmong-Mien
